#: includes/class-msvcalc-privacy.php:41
msgid "When you ask for a quote with our volume calculator, we collect the details you enter (such as your name, email address, phone number, moving addresses and date) and your list of items. We use them only to prepare and send your quote. They are emailed to us and kept in our website database until we delete them, or for the period we set for quote requests. You can ask us for a copy of this data or ask us to erase it."
