#: includes/class-msvcalc-privacy.php:42
msgid "With your request we also record when you agreed to our consent statement and its wording, the page you sent it from and the website that referred you (if any). Our team may add internal notes and reminders about your enquiry. All of this is included when you ask for a copy of your data and removed when you ask us to erase it."
msgstr ""

